2. Transportation:
(a) umbilical cord blood shall be transported from the birthing center to
the designated laboratory under end as per procedure prescribed by the
cord blood bank;
(b) the transportation procedure shall be validated to ensure optimum
survival of the Stem Cells;
(c) the transportation temperature should be between 18 to 28°C;
(d) the time period between collection and processing shall not exceed
72 hours.

